  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Readmission Capacity Building Facility (EURCAP) - Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the EU Readmission Capacity Building Facility (EURCAP) is to contribute to effective and efficient cooperation in migration governance between the EU and its partner countries through capacity-building initiatives. The EURCAP Facility aims at strengthening partner countries&#x2019; capacities to manage returns and cooperate on readmission with the EU as well as to prevent irregular migration.</narrative>
  </description>
